        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-486, Distressed Cabinet Knob Roses</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Distressed Cabinet Knob Round Rose is available in 6 beautiful finishes and can be used with any cabinet knob or pull. It's a great way to add the last finishing touch to any kitchen cabinet. This cabinet knob backplate has a 1-9/16 inch diameter. The distressed detailing really helps bring out the highlights of the finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUse with matching <a href=\"/products/distressed-beveled-edge-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-711\"><b>CK-711 Distressed Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-486 Traditional Cabinet Knob Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TR100_size.gif?v=1704354719\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
